        <Param val="Sentence–Picture Matching Task&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this task, you will see four pictures on the screen. After a few seconds, you will hear an English sentence that stops before its last word.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your task is to click on the picture that best completes the sentence.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can click only after the sentence has ended. Please respond as quickly and as accurately as you can.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Each trial begins with a cross (+) in the centre of the screen. Please look at the cross when it appears.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will first complete 4 practice trials.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press the SPACE bar to start the practice." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
